/E (This is E-commerce based on android application, build using Kotlin language with several key features including displaying a list of products, adding items to the cart and wishlist, performing checkout, and conducting payment transactions all within a single Android application. I created this project with a strong intent to enhance my skills and gain a deeper understanding of Android Architecture Components. This project reflects my dedication to learning and applying the latest technologies in mobile application development.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
